{
  "key": 17435,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_TryDressingUpPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Why don’t you try dressing up your\n",
        "Pokémon now?\r",
        "We have a Fitting Room on\n",
        "the second floor.\r",
        "Dress up your Pokémon nicely with\n",
        "Accessories!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pourquoi ne pas habiller\n",
        "votre Pokémon?\r",
        "Nous avons une cabine d’essayage au\n",
        "premier étage.\r",
        "Parez votre Pokémon de magnifiques\n",
        "Accessoires!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_ThisIsLotteryCorner",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Pokémon Lottery Corner.\n",
        "I’m Felicity, your attendant today.\r",
        "If your drawn number matches the\n",
        "ID No. of any of your Pokémon,\f",
        "you could win fabulous gifts.\r",
        "Would you like to check today’s lucky\n",
        "number?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue à la Loterie Pokémon.\n",
        "Mon nom est Felicity, pour vous servir.\r",
        "Si le numéro sur le Billet de Loterie\n",
        "correspond au numéro ID d’un de vos\f",
        "Pokémon, vous aurez un beau cadeau.\r",
        "Voulez-vous retirer un Billet de\n",
        "Loterie?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_AlreadyDrawnTicketToday",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve already drawn a Loto Ticket\n",
        "today. Please come back tomorrow."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous avez déjà retiré un Billet de\n",
        "Loterie aujourd’hui. Revenez demain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_PleaseVisitAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh. I see.\n",
        "Please do visit us again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, je vois.\n",
        "Nous espérons vous revoir bientôt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_LookUpTodaysLuckyNumber",
      "en_US": [
        "First, I’ll look up today’s Pokémon\n",
        "Lottery Corner lucky number.\r",
        "...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vérifions donc le numéro gagnant\n",
        "du jour.\r",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_YourLotoTicketNumberIsX",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Loto Ticket number is {STRVAR_1 54, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Now, let’s see if it matches the\n",
        "ID No. of any of your Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le numéro du Billet de Loterie est\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 54, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Je vais voir si ce numéro correspond\n",
        "à l’un des numéros ID de vos Pokémon.\f",
        "Veuillez patienter.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_IDOfTeamPokemonMatchesTicketNumber",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "The ID No. of your team’s\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\f",
        "Ticket number!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Félicitations!\r",
        "Un ou plusieurs chiffres du numéro ID\n",
        "de {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, qui est dans votre\r",
        "équipe, correspondent à ceux\n",
        "du Billet de Loterie!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_IDOfBoxedPokemonMatchesTicketNumber",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "The ID No. of your PC-boxed\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\f",
        "Ticket number!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Félicitations!\r",
        "Un ou plusieurs chiffres du numéro ID\n",
        "de {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, qui est stocké sur le\r",
        "PC, correspondent à ceux du\n",
        "Billet de Loterie!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_YouDidntGetAMatch",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry.\n",
        "You didn’t get a match..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quel dommage!\n",
        "Aucun des numéros ne correspond..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_LastDigitMatchedWinFourthPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "The last digit matched, so you\n",
        "win the fourth prize!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le dernier chiffre correspond, vous\n",
        "remportez le quatrième prix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_YouGainANewBackdropForUseInFittingRooms",
      "en_US": [
        "You gained a new Backdrop for use\n",
        "in Fitting Rooms."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous obtenez un nouveau Décor à\n",
        "utiliser dans la cabine d’essayage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_LastTwoDigitsMatchedWinThirdPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "The last two digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the third prize!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les deux derniers chiffres\n",
        "correspondent, vous remportez le\f",
        "troisième prix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_LastThreeDigitsMatchedWinSecondPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "The last three digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the second prize!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les trois derniers chiffres\n",
        "correspondent, vous remportez le\f",
        "deuxième prix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_LastFourDigitsMatchedWinFirstPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "The last four digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the first prize!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les quatre derniers chiffres\n",
        "correspondent, vous remportez le\f",
        "premier prix!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_AllDigitsMatchedWinJackpot",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my goodness, all five digits\n",
        "matched!\r",
        "You’ve won the jackpot prize!\n",
        "This is just so incredible!\r",
        "...Oh, I’m sorry! Your prize!\n",
        "I got carried away there.\r",
        "Here you go!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Magnifique, tous les chiffres\n",
        "correspondent!\r",
        "Vous avez gagné le gros lot!\n",
        "C’est tout simplement incroyable!\r",
        "... Oh, pardon! Votre prix!\n",
        "Je me suis laissé emporter.\r",
        "Tenez!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_NoRoomForThis",
      "en_US": [
        "...Oh?\n",
        "You seem to have no room for this.\r",
        "Please make room in your Bag and\n",
        "then let me know."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh?\n",
        "On dirait que vous n’avez plus de place.\r",
        "Faites de la place dans votre Sac et\n",
        "revenez me voir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_ThisIsPrizeWeveBeenHolding",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Yes, I’ve been expecting you.\r",
        "This is the prize we’ve been holding\n",
        "for you. Here you go!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Oui, je vous attendais.\r",
        "Nous vous avons gardé votre prix.\n",
        "Tenez!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_PleaseDoVisitAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Please do visit again!\n",
        "Good-bye from Felicity, your attendant!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "N’hésitez pas à revenir tenter votre\n",
        "chance! A bientôt!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_CheckLuckyNumberAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Pokémon Lottery Corner.\r",
        "Would you like to check today’s lucky\n",
        "number again?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue à la Loterie Pokémon.\r",
        "Désirez-vous revérifier le numéro\n",
        "gagnant du jour?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_TheyKeepTrackOfRecords",
      "en_US": [
        "They keep track of official records\n",
        "here.\r",
        "Things like winning streaks, or how many\n",
        "Pokémon you’ve caught.\r",
        "You can check everyone’s records\n",
        "up on the third floor."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est ici que toutes les données\n",
        "officielles sont enregistrées.\r",
        "La meilleure série de victoires, ou\n",
        "le nombre de captures, par exemple.\r",
        "Tu peux jeter un œil aux données des\n",
        "autres au deuxième étage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_CommercialsShownOnTV",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m going to get commercials shown\n",
        "on TV.\r",
        "They’ll attract more customers to\n",
        "the department store."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je vais diffuser des spots\n",
        "publicitaires à la télé.\r",
        "Ils attireront les clients au\n",
        "Centre Commercial Voilaroc."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeTV1F_Text_InterviewsAllSortsOfTrainers",
      "en_US": [
        "The TV station interviews all sorts of\n",
        "Trainers for its shows.\r",
        "After all, people want to know about\n",
        "good Trainers and what they say.\r",
        "Personally, I’d like to learn more about\n",
        "Gym Leaders.\r",
        "I’d also like to hear about the tough\n",
        "Elite Four of the Pokémon League."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Féli-Télé réalise des interviews de\n",
        "plein de Dresseurs pour ses émissions.\r",
        "Les gens veulent en savoir plus sur les\n",
        "Dresseurs et ce qu’ils ont à dire.\r",
        "Personnellement, j’aimerais mieux\n",
        "connaître les Champions d’Arène.\r",
        "Et le Conseil 4 de la Ligue Pokémon...\n",
        "Ça ferait un sujet passionnant!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}